1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,255
歡迎來到第一道工程活動：定義系統任務與封裝需求。
Welcome to activity one: defining system and package requirements.

2
00:00:06,255 --> 00:00:11,845
鏡頭下的加速器是教學模型，還沒有選定製造架構。
The accelerator below is a teaching model; its manufacturing architecture has not been selected.

3
00:00:11,845 --> 00:00:15,619
今天的成果是一張可追溯需求表。
Our deliverable is a traceable requirements table.

4
00:00:15,619 --> 00:00:23,036
你要說清楚它做什麼、在什麼條件下做到，以及用什麼證據判定合格。
State what the system must do, under which conditions, and which evidence will demonstrate success.

5
00:00:23,036 --> 00:00:30,000
漂亮的晶片堆疊，不能代替這三個答案。
An impressive stack of chips cannot replace those three answers.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,746
先把使用情境寫下來：這個假設的加速器要持續處理資料，不是只跑一秒的展示。
Begin with the use case. Our hypothetical accelerator must process a sustained workload, not a one-second demonstration.

7
00:00:38,746 --> 00:00:46,884
記錄資料大小、讀寫方向、尖峰與平均需求，還有允許的延遲和運作時間。
Record data size, read and write directions, peak and average demand, allowed latency, and operating duration.

8
00:00:46,884 --> 00:00:52,212
畫面中短高柱是突發流量，長平台是持續負載。
The short tall bars represent bursts; the long plateau represents sustained activity.

9
00:00:52,212 --> 00:01:00,000
兩者都要描述；只抄介面的最高速率，無法代表應用表現。
Describe both. An interface's headline rate alone does not describe application performance.

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,349
現在建立四個需求編號：頻寬、散熱、空間與測試。
Create four requirement identifiers: bandwidth, thermal performance, physical envelope, and test access.

11
00:01:06,349 --> 00:01:12,262
每一列都要有條件、單位、門檻、驗證方法與責任人。
Every row needs conditions, units, a threshold, a verification method, and an owner.

12
00:01:12,262 --> 00:01:19,268
比如頻寬這列，要寫單一方向的有效資料率，而不是含糊的很快。
For bandwidth, specify useful data rate in one direction, not simply fast.

13
00:01:19,268 --> 00:01:23,661
尚未取得的數字保持待定，指定誰補齊。
Leave unknown values open and assign responsibility for resolving them.

14
00:01:23,661 --> 00:01:30,000
提案、估算與實測通過，是三種不同狀態。
A proposal, an estimate, and a measured pass are different states.

15
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:40,753
看這個教學算例：單向六十四條通道，每條每秒十六吉位元，原始總量是一千零二十四吉位元。
Consider this teaching example: sixty-four lanes in one direction, each carrying sixteen gigabits per second. Raw aggregate rate is one thousand twenty-four gigabits per second.

16
00:01:40,753 --> 00:01:49,973
假設協定與負載合計效率八成，再除以八換成位元組，得到每秒一百零二點四吉位元組。
Assume eighty percent combined protocol and workload efficiency; divide by eight to obtain one hundred two point four gigabytes per second.

17
00:01:49,973 --> 00:02:00,000
這不是任何標準的保證規格；效率、方向與流量型態，都必須另外驗證。
This is arithmetic, not a standards guarantee. Verify efficiency, direction, and traffic conditions separately.

18
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,230
散熱也先做有條件的估算。
Start thermal planning with explicit assumptions.

19
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:12,685
假設持續功率二百五十瓦，完整冷卻系統的有效熱阻是每瓦零點一八度，環境三十五度。
Assume two hundred fifty watts sustained, an effective resistance of zero point one eight kelvin per watt for the complete cooling system, and thirty-five degrees ambient.

20
00:02:12,685 --> 00:02:18,683
簡化穩態估算得到八十度，比假設上限八十五度低五度。
A lumped steady-state estimate gives eighty degrees, five below our illustrative limit.

21
00:02:18,683 --> 00:02:21,764
但這不是最熱晶粒的驗證結果。
That is not verified peak junction temperature.

22
00:02:21,764 --> 00:02:30,000
接面、氣流、局部功率與暫態，都還需要建模和量測。
Interfaces, airflow, local power, and transients still require modeling and measurement.

23
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,496
把視角拉到主機板。
Pull back to the board.

24
00:02:32,496 --> 00:02:41,383
案例暫留六十乘六十毫米、封裝本體高四毫米的空間，散熱器和固定件要另外計算。
Reserve sixty by sixty millimeters and four millimeters of package-body height in this example; budget the cooler and mounting hardware separately.

25
00:02:41,383 --> 00:02:48,750
再畫出電源進入晶粒的路徑，指定供電範圍、壓降預算與量測位置。
Trace power into the dies, and specify supply range, voltage-drop budget, and measurement points.

26
00:02:48,750 --> 00:03:00,000
小封裝不一定帶來小系統；插座、電容、走線和維修空間，都會改變最後布局。
A smaller package does not automatically make a smaller system. Sockets, capacitors, routing, and service clearances affect the layout.

27
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:04,221
在晶粒被蓋住之前，決定怎麼觀察故障。
Before a die becomes inaccessible, decide how faults will be observed.

28
00:03:04,221 --> 00:03:10,036
先確認裸晶的測試資料，再規劃組裝後的連線與功能測試。
Review incoming die-test evidence, then plan interconnect and functional tests after assembly.

29
00:03:10,036 --> 00:03:15,854
畫面的探針代表可控制、可觀測的入口，不是實際探針尺寸。
The probes symbolize controllable, observable access; their size is illustrative.

30
00:03:15,854 --> 00:03:19,016
測不到的內部節點不能假裝正常。
An unobservable internal node cannot simply be assumed good.

31
00:03:19,016 --> 00:03:30,000
需求表要交代故障範圍、測試階段與資料歸屬，避免昂貴組裝後才發現缺口。
Record fault scope, test stage, and data ownership, so expensive integration does not reveal a missing test strategy.

32
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,757
現在才比較候選架構。
Now compare candidate architectures.

33
00:03:32,757 --> 00:03:42,928
矽中介層、扇出重佈線與局部矽橋，是不同的互連路線；垂直混合鍵合還可能與其中某些路線組合。
Silicon interposers, fan-out redistribution, and local silicon bridges provide different interconnect routes. Vertical hybrid bonding can also combine with some routes.

34
00:03:42,928 --> 00:03:46,853
不要把它們排成每個產品都必經的流水線。
Do not turn them into a mandatory serial factory line.

35
00:03:46,853 --> 00:03:53,146
比較有效頻寬、功率、尺寸、測試能力、供應條件與總成本。
Compare useful bandwidth, power, dimensions, test access, supply conditions, and total cost.

36
00:03:53,146 --> 00:04:00,000
此刻保留候選，先列出需要證明的差異。
Keep alternatives open while identifying the evidence needed to distinguish them.

37
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:12,554
試著破壞剛才的假設：若實際冷卻系統有效熱阻變成每瓦零點二二度，同樣功率下，簡化估算就升到九十度，超過案例門檻。
Challenge the cooling assumption. If effective system resistance rises to zero point two two kelvin per watt, the same screening calculation reaches ninety degrees, exceeding our example limit.

38
00:04:12,554 --> 00:04:16,863
這是待解決的風險，不是漂亮動畫中的通過。
That is an unresolved risk, not an animated pass.

39
00:04:16,863 --> 00:04:23,610
保存模型版本、邊界條件、量測位置與誤差，再比較持續吞吐量。
Preserve model revision, boundary conditions, measurement locations, and uncertainty. Then check sustained throughput.

40
00:04:23,610 --> 00:04:30,000
降頻後的速度，也必須算進需求驗證。
Any performance reduction from thermal throttling belongs in the verification result.

41
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,101
最後回到全貌。
Return to the complete system.

42
00:04:32,101 --> 00:04:37,350
你交付的是有版本的需求基線，以及仍未解決的事項。
Deliver a versioned requirements baseline and an explicit open-issues list.

43
00:04:37,350 --> 00:04:45,076
每項關鍵需求，都要連到負責人和驗證證據；還沒量到的，維持待驗證。
Link each critical requirement to an owner and its verification evidence; unmeasured items remain unverified.

44
00:04:45,076 --> 00:04:51,650
下一道活動是功能與晶粒分割，把需求轉成候選系統構成。
Next comes functional and die partitioning, turning requirements into candidate system compositions.

45
00:04:51,650 --> 00:05:00,000
先問清楚成功的條件，後面的每一道製造與測試，才知道要證明什麼。
Defining success first gives every later manufacturing and testing activity a clear purpose and a claim to demonstrate.
